  dialogueNodes:
  - dialogueText: Dear child, arise and  travel through these enchanting lands. A
      radiant future awaits you, filled with boundless possibilities. Use E to interact
      with the world around you.
    dialogueChoises: []
  - dialogueText: Take heart and begin your adventure. Use WASD keys to move.
    dialogueChoises: []
  - dialogueText: '[not in the actual game] Welcome to the version 0.2 of Aspect
      of Light. There is a lot of new things here. Take your time and have fun.'
    dialogueChoises: []
  - dialogueText: '[not in the actual game] By the way, I know the player speed is
      not right considering the movement animation. In the future we will have a
      crippled player animation, so that''''s why.'
    dialogueChoises: []
  - dialogueText: "[not in the actual game] Anyways, good luck!\n- sim\xF5es"
    dialogueChoises: []
